+# CONTRACT — Reactive Spreadsheet Engine
+
+Definition of done. Every box must pass via the corresponding Vitest check.
+
+## Cell references & values
+- [ ] `set`/`get` round-trips a number -> test: set('A1', 42); get('A1') === 42
+- [ ] round-trips a float -> test: set('A1', 3.14); get('A1') === 3.14
+- [ ] round-trips a string -> test: set('A1', 'hello'); get('A1') === 'hello'
+- [ ] round-trips a boolean -> test: set('A1', true); get('A1') === true
+- [ ] empty cell returns null -> test: get('Z9') === null
+- [ ] cell refs are case-insensitive -> test: set('a1', 5); get('A1') === 5
+- [ ] multi-letter columns work -> test: set('AA1', 1); set('AB2', 2); get reads back
+- [ ] getDisplay: number -> "30", float -> "3.14", string -> text, bool -> "true"/"false", empty -> ""
+- [ ] getCells returns only non-empty cells as Map ref->value
+
+## Arithmetic formulas
+- [ ] `=A1+A2` sums -> test: 10+20 === 30
+- [ ] subtraction, multiplication, division -> test each operator
+- [ ] operator precedence: `=A1+A2*2` -> test: 10+20*2 === 50
+- [ ] parentheses: `=(A1+A2)*2` -> test: (10+20)*2 === 60
+- [ ] unary minus: `=-A1` -> test: -10
+- [ ] numeric literals in formulas: `=2+3` -> 5
+- [ ] empty cell treated as 0 in arithmetic -> test: =A1+Z9 with Z9 empty
+- [ ] boolean coerces to 1/0 in arithmetic -> test: =A1+1 with A1=true -> 2
+- [ ] division by zero -> error value "#DIV/0!"
+- [ ] non-numeric string in arithmetic -> error value "#VALUE!"
+
+## Functions
+- [ ] SUM over column range A1:A5 -> test: sum
+- [ ] SUM over row range A1:C1 -> test: sum
+- [ ] SUM over block range A1:B2 -> test: sum of 4 cells
+- [ ] SUM ignores non-numeric cells -> test: mix of numbers and strings
+- [ ] AVERAGE -> mean of numeric values
+- [ ] AVERAGE of empty range -> "#DIV/0!"
+- [ ] MIN / MAX over range
+- [ ] COUNT counts only numeric values
+- [ ] IF true branch / false branch -> test both
+- [ ] comparison ops in IF: >, <, >=, <=, =, <> -> test each
+- [ ] nested functions: =SUM(A1:A2)+AVERAGE(B1:B2) and =IF(SUM(..)>x,..,..)
+
+## Reactive updates
+- [ ] changing a dependency recomputes dependents -> test: A1 5->10 updates B1=A1+1
+- [ ] transitive chains recompute -> test: A1->B1->C1 chain
+- [ ] range dependents recompute -> test: changing a cell in a SUM range updates the sum
+- [ ] setting a cell that was empty triggers dependents that referenced it
+- [ ] overwriting a formula with a literal updates dependents and drops old deps
+
+## Circular references
+- [ ] direct self-reference A1=A1 throws
+- [ ] two-cell cycle A1=B1, B1=A1 throws
+- [ ] indirect cycle through 3+ cells throws
+- [ ] a thrown cycle leaves prior state unchanged (no partial mutation)
+- [ ] breaking-then-reusing refs that don't cycle does not throw
+
+## Errors / edge cases
+- [ ] invalid cell ref in API throws
+- [ ] malformed formula throws on set (parse error)
+- [ ] unknown function throws
+- [ ] error values propagate through dependent formulas
+
+## Quality gates
+- [ ] `npm test` passes
+- [ ] `npm run build` (tsc) clean
+- [ ] `npm run lint` clean
